      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHOWMAN BAZ (1) was quickly out of the boxes with a slick early sectional clocking 22.31 with a 4.5 lengths win at Bulli over 400m. The form out of his last race has been franked. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. WINSOME JUMBO (4) shapes well for this backing up a strong 29.66 win with success at this track over 520m last time, recording 29.92. Should be in this for a long way. LADY LLORONA (2) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.75 lengths at Gosford in a handy 29.78 beating Mia Zipper. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. One of the key runners again. TAKE A BREAK (8) can feature with the right run.",
